                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "78221309-2202-4012-92aa-76957d7a93e5",
                        "source_entry_id": "27e1fde9-dbcd-3650-a666-60b6007a3c8b",
                        "target_lang_word": "thin",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thin",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98149706-d241-3e18-9219-1654ae5fc64e",
                                        "entry_id": "3722d21c-d25a-35b3-831f-57fb0d7fcf19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having little thickness or extent from one surface to its opposite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "847149c6-3d19-44db-b3fe-41f6b6a8029a",
                                                "sense_id": "98149706-d241-3e18-9219-1654ae5fc64e",
                                                "text": "thin plate of metal; thin paper; thin board; thin covering"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "800c5082-ac62-4d4d-8c72-03217116f2af",
                                                "sense_id": "98149706-d241-3e18-9219-1654ae5fc64e",
                                                "text": "It was no mystery at all, or a mystery covered only with the thinnest and most transparent veil, that forced abortion is a common practice among Turkish women. The horrible secret as to the means and the drugs to be employed is pretty generally known, and where ignorance prevails there are \"wise women,\" old hags, professional abortists, who go about the country relieving matrons of their burthens for a few piastres apiece […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "657dd71c-38ce-4509-9a28-48f2839bf84d",
                                                "sense_id": "98149706-d241-3e18-9219-1654ae5fc64e",
                                                "text": "Out of spite, the human beings pretended not to believe that it was Snowball who had destroyed the windmill: they said that it had fallen down because the walls were too thin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02108cb7-54a9-40e1-b629-7fd8a133b100",
                                                "sense_id": "98149706-d241-3e18-9219-1654ae5fc64e",
                                                "text": "The newest form of gold created in a lab is the thickness of two atoms, according to a new study. It’s only 0.47 nanometers thick, which is one million times thinner than a human finger nail. […] This makes it the thinnest unsupported gold ever created and it could be used in electronics and medical devices going forward.\nThe gold is made up of two layers of atoms stacked on top of each other. But don’t let the thin structure fool you."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "252af173-6a1e-3a6e-a61f-ce5d2166bf1b",
                                        "entry_id": "3722d21c-d25a-35b3-831f-57fb0d7fcf19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very narrow in all diameters; having a cross section that is small in all directions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6f2edef-921a-4139-9dd8-d4cc6d495975",
                                                "sense_id": "252af173-6a1e-3a6e-a61f-ce5d2166bf1b",
                                                "text": "thin wire; thin string"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f380c51-9181-45bc-a41f-bc7a1088caca",
                                                "sense_id": "252af173-6a1e-3a6e-a61f-ce5d2166bf1b",
                                                "text": "Typically, osteoporosis causes the amount of trabecular bone to be reduced and the bone to become thinner, while the intertrabecular space enlarges and the interconnected structure of trabecular bone is disrupted."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4cff2c4e-3deb-32e5-98f2-b2378a572026",
                                        "entry_id": "3722d21c-d25a-35b3-831f-57fb0d7fcf19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having little body fat or flesh; slim; slender; lean; gaunt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26450412-1033-4a06-af9f-a32a959bc50a",
                                                "sense_id": "4cff2c4e-3deb-32e5-98f2-b2378a572026",
                                                "text": "thin person"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "59b75c1b-efc6-31fe-9642-50df35dc4197",
                                        "entry_id": "3722d21c-d25a-35b3-831f-57fb0d7fcf19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of low viscosity or low specific gravity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d843ed0c-0fd2-44f0-8c1c-f425e7eba03e",
                                                "sense_id": "59b75c1b-efc6-31fe-9642-50df35dc4197",
                                                "text": "Water is thinner than honey."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29f8e2d2-08a5-3310-a161-ef559ab5f9cd",
                                        "entry_id": "3722d21c-d25a-35b3-831f-57fb0d7fcf19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Scarce; not close, crowded, or numerous; not filling the space."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "660e5c98-2ce1-47d9-86bd-25d4ca9fc49b",
                                                "sense_id": "29f8e2d2-08a5-3310-a161-ef559ab5f9cd",
                                                "text": "The trees of a forest are thin; the corn or grass is thin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da8ef729-9ab1-466c-9efe-64f70ed9b637",
                                                "sense_id": "29f8e2d2-08a5-3310-a161-ef559ab5f9cd",
                                                "text": "Ferrara is very large, but extremely thin of people."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab4a64d0-0267-3cc2-b57b-6fc0d88f9050",
                                        "entry_id": "3722d21c-d25a-35b3-831f-57fb0d7fcf19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Describing a poorly played golf shot where the ball is struck by the bottom part of the club head. See fat, shank, toe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d56e4417-1729-37de-81ba-453f68001b89",
                                        "entry_id": "3722d21c-d25a-35b3-831f-57fb0d7fcf19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lacking body or volume; small; feeble; not full."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
